# Freeze: a hit every 8 steps into a short reverb (P1 90, ~1.4 s). A note held on the FX track from step 10 to 30 holds
# the tail at its level and keeps the hits at steps 16 and 24 out; after the release it decays, and later hits ring
# normally again.
tempo 120
steps 64
tail 1
track fx2
input impulse 8 0.9
preset 90 150 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
gain 1
note 10 C4 20 100
expect sound 8 64
expect peak_below -6
